  "prompt_template": "@options\nGive each question between 4 and 5 options. Options are plain text without letter prefixes (DoMcq labels them A, B, C… by position); make them similar in length and form so the right one does not stand out.\nGive almost every question exactly 5 options, as NCCPA's own sample PANCE questions do; use 4 options only now and then, never fewer.\nEvery question has exactly one correct option; `answer` is a single letter.\nNever use these as an option: \"all of the above\", \"none of the above\". Avoid \"both A and B\" style options too.",
